			"label": "Instr."
		},
		{
			"id": "60f09dc5c2670165",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "上面三種 MIPS 沒有",
			"x": 740,
			"y": 403,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "3a1164885a319f68",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/RISC_V/11-Instr - offset 的都是.png",
			"x": 300,
			"y": 140,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 145
		},
		{
			"id": "78de85d259e2369d",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/RISC_V/15-Instr - 上面三種 MIPS 沒有.png",
			"x": 300,
			"y": 360,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 145
		},
		{
			"id": "b51eef0a955241f9",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/RISC_V/03-Instr.png",
			"x": 300,
			"y": -247,
			"width": 398,
			"height": 109
		},
		{
			"id": "46448b8347f76e5c",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/RISC_V/07-Instr - offset 的都是.png",
			"x": 300,
			"y": -60,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 129
		},
		{
			"id": "b465fd823d02b98a",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "$32 \\times 64 \\text{bits}$ 的 register file\n",
			"x": -140,
			"y": 298,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60
		},
		{
			"id": "3b5833a28e4e74a9",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "offset 的都是 $12 \\text{ bits}$ ",
			"x": 740,
			"y": -25,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "da11a0a9fb2c7374",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "MIPS 都是 PC-relative 跳躍，如果把 jal x0, 100 就是無條件跳躍，那他是 $20 \\text{ bit}$，那他們兩個 instr. format 不同",
			"x": 740,
			"y": 799,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 115,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "6ac997df699df723",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "記得要擴充 $20$，因為是 12 bit，在 addi 上面，然後可以 4G 的範圍因為 auipc 這個指令可以搭配 jalr 從 PC 往上或是往下跳，然後後面的 const 是 20 bits",
			"x": 740,
			"y": -250,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 115,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "1894255c7dbcfb8b",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/RISC_V/19-Instr.png",
			"x": 300,
			"y": 592,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 148
		},
		{
			"id": "049b6921b4f9db96",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/RISC_V/18-Concept.png",
			"x": -593,
			"y": 480,
			"width": 386,
			"height": 240
		},
		{
			"id": "f76326857b556acc",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/RISC_V/25-Instr.png",
			"x": 300,
			"y": 820,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 73
		},
		{
			"id": "c0a141720e41bea0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "這邊跳躍是以自己為基準，但是 MIPS 是以下面那個指令的位置為基準，那麼只有 $12 \\text{ bit}$",
			"x": 740,
			"y": 624,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 85,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "42a4fe082742d9c9",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/RISC_V/01-Concept - 這幾個是基本模組,要用的時候要四選一.png",
			"x": -600,
			"y": -280,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 133
		},
		{
			"id": "cf344428554ef8c7",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/RISC_V/06-Concept - 擴充模組看你要用哪一個模組這樣.png",
			"x": -600,
			"y": -80,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 224
		},
		{
			"id": "059d3230798050a8",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/RISC_V/12-Concept.png",
			"x": -600,
			"y": 240,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 176
		},
		{
			"id": "4d38620384fe4a02",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "S 開頭 register 12 個比 MIPS 8 個還多。\n",
			"x": -161,
			"y": 572,
			"width": 335,
			"height": 57
		},
		{
			"id": "52f82e9db00a9557",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/RISC_V/24-Concept.png",
			"x": -600,
			"y": 800,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 194
		},
		{
			"id": "e105c95791572dd4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "$2^{64}$ byte 這麼大可以寫的程式容量也就是定址範圍，byte addressing，Little Endian，aligned 不用不會差太多效率上。",
			"x": -160,
			"y": 855,
			"width": 334,
			"height": 85,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "39e8b0aea427d03e",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "這幾個是基本模組，要用的時候要四選一",
			"x": -100,
			"y": -243,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "465b402c2d5060f9",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "擴充模組看你要用哪一個模組這樣",
			"x": -100,
			"y": -4,
			"width": 259,
			"height": 72,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "3b9c2ec2046f6d16",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "跟 MIPS 比有四個不一樣\n1. RegDst 沒有 MUX 和控制訊號線。\n2. ImmGen 排好擴充。\n3. 還有 PC 相對的定址模試所以是直接從 PC 拿出來，不是相對 PC+4。\n4. 還有 shift 1 的原因是因為 0 那個欄位所以只需要 shfit 1 就好了。",
			"x": 4300,
			"y": 1120,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 228,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "1d1261ac47623372",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/RISC_V/17-MIPS 也是一樣.png",
			"x": 4460,
			"y": 417,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 240
		},
